  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="overline">⚠ Advocacy Poster — Feeding America</div>
    <h1>Hunger Doesn't Wait — <span>Together We Can End It</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">48 million Americans face hunger. A nationwide network of food banks, volunteers, and advocates is fighting back — and you can help.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Crisis Stats Bar -->
  <div class="stat-bar">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-value">48M</div>
      <div class="stat-label">People Facing Hunger</div>
      <div class="stat-sub">across every U.S. community</div>
